then other: friend.close

rule x7_fn_wedding
when concept=friend.news conv.fq=wedding
does react.news
priority 2
say {fx=wed} I cried. Don't tell anyone. | {fx=wed} Danced till my paws ached. | {fx=wed} Missed it, more's the pity. I heard it was lovely.
then other: friend.close

rule x7_fn_death
when concept=friend.news conv.fq=death
does react.news
priority 2
say {fx=sad} I heard. Terrible. | {fx=sad} Aye. I'll be at the burying. | {fx=sad} Gods rest them.
then other: friend.close

rule x7_fn_birth
when concept=friend.news conv.fq=birth
does react.news
priority 2
