then other: friend.close

rule x7_fn_crime
when concept=friend.news conv.fq=crime
does react.news
priority 2
say {fx=worry} I heard. I've put a second bolt on. | {fx=worry} Nobody's safe. Nobody. | {fx=worry} The Watch'll have them. I hope.
then other: friend.close

rule x7_fn_festival
when concept=friend.news conv.fq=festival
does react.news
priority 2
say {fx=fest_soon} Wouldn't miss it! | {fx=fest_soon} Course I'm going. I've been practising my dancing. | {fx=fest_soon} If I can get the day off.
then other: friend.close

rule x7_fn_prices
when concept=friend.news conv.fq=prices
does react.news
priority 2
say {fx=dear} Robbery. Plain robbery. | {fx=dear} I saw. I'll be going without, then. | {fx=dear} Don't. Don't, I'll weep.
then other: friend.close

rule x7_fn_prices_rich
when concept=friend.news conv.fq=prices self.wealth=rich
does react.news
priority 3
