then other: friend.close

rule x7_fn_prices_merchant
when concept=friend.news conv.fq=prices self.role=merchant
does react.news
priority 3
say {fx=dear} Don't look at me. I pay more too. | {fx=dear} It's the roads. Blame the roads. | {fx=dear} You think I like it? I'm selling less.
then other: friend.close

rule x7_fn_child
when concept=friend.news conv.fq=child
does react.news
priority 2
