then other: friend.close

## The last word (friend.close; self: the first speaker again; conv.fx: how the other answered)

rule x7_fc_any
when concept=friend.close
does farewell
say Ha! Well, mind how you go. | Right. Good. Off I go. | Can't stand here all day. #later.capitalize#! | Look after yourself.

rule x7_fc_any2
when concept=friend.close
does farewell
say I'll let you get on. | Right you are. | Go on then, #pet#.

rule x7_fc_ok
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=ok
does farewell
priority 2
say Good. That's good. | Glad to hear it. | Keep it that way. | That's all we can ask.

rule x7_fc_meh
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=meh
does farewell
priority 2
say Ah well. Could be worse. | Aren't we all, #pet#. | It'll pass, whatever it is. | Chin up. Spring always comes. Eventually.

rule x7_fc_lots
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=lots
does farewell
priority 2
say Gods, and I only asked. | You can tell me the rest on Restday. | Ha! Breathe, #pet#. Breathe.

rule x7_fc_spouse
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=spouse
does farewell
priority 2
say Ha! That's marriage, #pet#. | Give them my best all the same. | Sounds about right.

rule x7_fc_tired
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=tired
does farewell
priority 2
say Get some sleep, #pet#. | Go home and put your feet up. | Bed. Now. I mean it.

rule x7_fc_hungry
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=hungry
does farewell
priority 2
say Come by later, there's broth on. | Here, I've half a loaf. Take it. | Go eat something before you fall over.

rule x7_fc_hungry_poor
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=hungry self.wealth=poor|destitute
does farewell
priority 3
say Me too. Me too. | Join the club. | If I had a crust I'd split it with you.

rule x7_fc_poor
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=poor
does farewell
priority 2
say If it gets bad, you come to me. | It'll turn. It always turns. | Chin up. Something'll come along.

rule x7_fc_poor_rich
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=poor self.wealth=rich
does farewell
priority 3
say Here. No, take it. Don't argue. | Come and see me. I'll find you some work. | You should have said. You should always say.

rule x7_fc_good
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=good
does farewell
priority 2
say Well, look at you! | Don't forget us little folk. | Good for you. Truly.

rule x7_fc_good_poor
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=good self.wealth=poor|destitute
does farewell
priority 3
say Must be nice. | Lend us a penny, then. | Some of us, eh?

rule x7_fc_bad
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=bad
does farewell
priority 2
say It'll pick up. | Chin up. Market day's coming. | I'll send folk your way. Promise.

rule x7_fc_hurt
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=hurt
does farewell
priority 2
say See a healer, you daft thing. | Keep off it a few days. | Who was it? Just tell me who.

rule x7_fc_grief
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=grief
does farewell
priority 2
say Anything you need. Anything. | I'm so sorry, #pet#. | I'll bring something round. Don't argue.

rule x7_fc_grief_devout
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=grief|thanked self.piety=devout
does farewell
priority 3
say The Bright One keeps them now. | I'll light a candle tonight. | #bless.capitalize#, #pet#.

rule x7_fc_thanked
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=thanked
does farewell
priority 2
say Come by any time. Any time at all. | Lean on me. That's what I'm for. | You know where I am.

rule x7_fc_lonely
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=lonely
does farewell
priority 2
say Come for #supper#. Restday. I mean it. | You've always a seat at mine. | Don't sit in alone. Come and find me.

rule x7_fc_sad
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=sad
does farewell
priority 2
say Aye. Gods rest them. | Hard times. | We'll all be there.

rule x7_fc_robbed
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=robbed
does farewell
priority 2
say Scum. I'll keep an ear out. | Thieves. Hanging's too good. | If you need anything to tide you over, say.

rule x7_fc_fought
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=fought
does farewell
priority 2
say Ha! You never could keep out of trouble. | Next time, walk away. Or win properly. | Put something cold on that eye.

rule x7_fc_child
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=child
does farewell
priority 2
say That's the job, #pet#. It never stops. | Give them my love. | Ha! They're worth it. Mostly.

rule x7_fc_work
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=work
does farewell
priority 2
say Ha! We all started somewhere. | It gets easier. Well, it doesn't, but you get used to it. | Patience. That's the trade.

rule x7_fc_busy
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=busy
does farewell
priority 2
say Go on then, don't let me keep you. | Off you go! | Don't work too hard.

rule x7_fc_free
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=free
does farewell
priority 2
say Lucky you! | Enjoy it. You've earned it. | Some of us still have work.

rule x7_fc_road
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=road
does farewell
priority 2
say Safe roads, then. | Tell me all about it next time. | Mind yourself out there.

rule x7_fc_wedding
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=wedding
does farewell
priority 2
say You look grand. Go on! | Dance once for me. | Bring me back some cake!

rule x7_fc_wed
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=wed
does farewell
priority 2
say Best day this town's had in a month. | Ha! There'll be pups by next spring, mark me. | They'll be happy, those two. You can always tell.

rule x7_fc_pup_news
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=pup_news
does farewell
priority 2
say Bless the little thing. | The grandparents'll be unbearable now. | One more for the Commons School, eh?

rule x7_fc_merry
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=merry
does farewell
priority 2
say Ha! You never change. | Fool. I love you. Go away. | Ha! Get on with you.

rule x7_fc_cold
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=cold
does farewell
priority 2
say Get yourself by a fire. | Keep moving. Keep moving! | Spring, #pet#. It'll come.

rule x7_fc_nowhere
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=nowhere|errand
does farewell
priority 2
say #bc_fair_enough# | Mind how you go, then. | Well, don't get lost.

rule x7_fc_work_where
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=working
does farewell
priority 2
say Better you than me. | Go on, earn your crust. | See you at the end of it.

rule x7_fc_home
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=home
does farewell
priority 2
say Sleep well. | Rest those feet. | Off with you, then. #later.capitalize#.

rule x7_fc_market
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=market
does farewell
priority 2
say Don't let them rob you. | Bring me back a pie, there's a dear. | Mind your purse in the crush.

rule x7_fc_chapel
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=chapel
does farewell
priority 2
say Say a prayer for me. | Light one for my mother, will you? | I'll be along. Maybe.

rule x7_fc_chapel_maybe
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=chapel_maybe
does farewell
priority 2
say Ha! Your secret's safe with me. | The Bright One sees you, mind. | I'll not tell your mother.

rule x7_fc_tavern
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=tavern
does farewell
priority 2
say Don't drink it all. Save me one. | One, you said. I'll be counting. | Ha! I'll be along.

rule x7_fc_festival
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=festival
does farewell
priority 2
say Save me a dance! | Ha! Wait for me! | Don't eat all the cakes!

rule x7_fc_fest_soon
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=fest_soon
does farewell
priority 2
say Good. It's no fun without you. | I'll hold you to that. | Bring your dancing paws.

rule x7_fc_comeback
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=comeback
does farewell
priority 2
say {fp=light} Ha! Fair. | {fp=light} Got me there. | {fp=light} You'll keep. | {fp=light} Ha! I walked into that.
then other: friend.parting

rule x7_fc_tease
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=tease
does farewell
priority 2
say {fp=light} Only teasing, #pet#. | {fp=light} Ha! Your face! | {fp=light} You know I love you really.
then other: friend.parting

rule x7_fc_sore
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=sore
does farewell
priority 2
say All right, all right. Only teasing. | Someone's in a mood. | Sorry. Sorry! Gods.

rule x7_fc_shy
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=shy
does farewell
priority 2
say I'm only teasing! You look fine. | No, no, you look lovely. Honest. | Ha! Don't fret, #pet#.

rule x7_fc_owe
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=owe
does farewell
priority 2
say Ha! I'll hold you to it. | I've a long memory, #pet#. | I'll be counting, mind.

rule x7_fc_pup
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=pup
does farewell
priority 2
say Ha! Mind you grow into those ears. | That's the spirit. Off you go. | Ha! Say hello to your #mum# for me.

rule x7_fc_sorry
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=sorry
does farewell
priority 2
say Ah, no harm done. | Never mind. It's only a bit of #mud#. | Ha! I'd only mention it to you.

rule x7_fc_yes
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=yes
does farewell
priority 2
say {fp=light} I'll hold you to it! | {fp=light} Good. Don't be late. | {fp=light} Wonderful! I'll get #drink# in.
then other: friend.parting

rule x7_fc_fed
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=fed
does farewell
priority 2
say Good. Come hungry. | Dusk, then. There'll be plenty. | Don't thank me. Just eat.

rule x7_fc_proud
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=proud
does farewell
priority 2
say Nobody said charity. I said supper. | Suit yourself. The door's open. | Then come for the company. The food's just there.

rule x7_fc_skint
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=skint
does farewell
priority 2
say My treat. Don't argue. | Who said anything about paying? | Bring yourself. That'll do.

rule x7_fc_no
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=no
does farewell
priority 2
say Another time, then. | I'll ask again, mind. | Your loss. Ha!

rule x7_fc_maybe
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=maybe
does farewell
priority 2
say Maybe's as good as yes. | I'll take a maybe. | I'll save you a seat anyway.

rule x7_fc_occasion
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=occasion
does farewell
priority 2
say {fp=light} Does there have to be one? | {fp=light} Being alive. That's the occasion. | {fp=light} You. You're the occasion. Ha!
then other: friend.parting

rule x7_fc_news
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=news
does farewell
priority 2
say Ha! Well, there it is. | That's the talk of the street, anyway. | I'll tell you the rest later.

rule x7_fc_gossip
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=gossip
does farewell
priority 2
say {fp=light} Later! Later! | {fp=light} Ha! Come by tonight and I'll tell you. | {fp=light} Can't. Not here. Walls have ears.
then other: friend.parting

rule x7_fc_worry
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=worry
does farewell
priority 2
say Mind yourself, that's all. | Strange times. | Stay in after dark, the pair of us.

rule x7_fc_dear
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=dear
does farewell
priority 2
say Aye, well. Somebody's getting fat on it. | It'll come down. They always say it will. | Bread and water, the pair of us.

rule x7_fc_rich
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=rich
does farewell
priority 2
say Of course you hadn't. | Must be lovely, being you. | Ha! Course not.

rule x7_fc_chapel_promise
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=chapel_promise
does farewell
priority 2
say I'll keep a place for you. | The Bright One's patient. I'm less so. | See that you do.

rule x7_fc_order
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=order
does farewell
priority 2
say Good. I'll come by. | Don't forget, mind. | No hurry. Well, a little hurry.

rule x7_fc_visit
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=visit
does farewell
priority 2
say I'll keep it by for you. | Good. Don't leave it too long. | Coin or no coin, come and say hello.

rule x7_fc_favour
when concept=friend.close conv.fx=favour
does farewell
priority 2
say You're a treasure. | I'll pay you back. Probably. | Ha! I'll stand you a cup for it.

## The other's last word (friend.parting; self: the second speaker again; conv.fp: light, funeral, blessing)

rule x7_fp_any
when concept=friend.parting conv.fp=light
does farewell.return
say #bc_go_on_then# | #later.capitalize#, #pet#. | Mind how you go. | Off you pop.

rule x7_fp_any2
when concept=friend.parting conv.fp=light
does farewell.return
say Aye, aye. | Ha! Get on. | See you, then.

rule x7_fp_warm
when concept=friend.parting conv.fp=light self.warmth=warm
does farewell.return
say Look after yourself, #pet#! | Come by soon, mind! | #bless.capitalize#.

rule x7_fp_devout
when concept=friend.parting conv.fp=light self.piety=devout
does farewell.return
say #bless.capitalize#. | Bright One keep you. | Go in peace.

rule x7_fp_cold
when concept=friend.parting conv.fp=light self.warmth=cold
does farewell.return
say Mm. | #bc_right# | Hm.

rule x7_fp_working
when concept=friend.parting conv.fp=light self.working=yes
does farewell.return
say Aye, back to it. | Can't stop. #later.capitalize#! | Work calls.

rule x7_fp_young
when concept=friend.parting conv.fp=light self.stage=young
does farewell.return
say Bye! | Bye bye! | See you!

rule x7_fp_merry
when concept=friend.parting conv.fp=light self.humour=merry
does farewell.return
say Ha! Mind you don't trip over your tail! | Off you go, trouble! | Ha! Go on, then, go on!

rule x7_fp_funeral
when concept=friend.parting conv.fp=funeral
does farewell.return
priority 2
say Gods keep them. | Go gently, #pet#. | I'll be thinking of you all.

rule x7_fp_funeral_devout
when concept=friend.parting conv.fp=funeral self.piety=devout
does farewell.return
priority 2
say Go with the Bright One's peace. | I'll light a candle for them. | #blessing#.

rule x7_fp_blessing
when concept=friend.parting conv.fp=blessing
does farewell.return
priority 2
say And to you, #pet#. | Bright One keep you. | Go in peace.
